{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "That's it from this Test. With one whole day being washed out, we still got the result as the rain gods showed mercy over the last two days. Pakistan continue their dominance on this tour whereas West Indies are left hapless once again. Will they be able to come back stronger and level the series or will Misbah's men take an unassailable lead? Join us for the 2nd Test starting from 30th April at Bridgetown to find out what happens next. Till then, it's goodbye from us! Cheers!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "MISBAH-UL-HAQ says that despite having a low target, it got tricky but adds that such things happen. Expresses joy having broken their six-match losing streak with a good victory. Reveals that the idea was to post a solid first innings score especially with the bad weather around. Says that the conditions helped on the first few days to restrict West Indies to a low score. Credits his bowlers, especially Amir and Yasir Shah for creating the win. Says that his side aren't shy to include another leg spinner if the conditions demand it but states that it could get dicey as a batsman will have to be compromised. Says that he is enjoying his last series of his international career.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "YASIR SHAH (MAN OF THE MATCH) says that the focus from him was to stick to the basics of line and length. Says that he had done his training well and states that it has paid off. Accepts that he had a couple of bad series but says that those weren't conditions that were aiding the spinners. However, adds that he wants to prove himself in all conditions.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "JASON HOLDER feels that they didn't have enough runs on the board. Laments the lack of partnerships which cost them. Praises Dowrich and Chase for their efforts. In the second innings, he feels that the batsmen didn't try hard enough and could have batted better. Says that it was always going to be tough to survive on the final day against Yasir Shah on a dry pitch. Credits his bowlers for trying hard and creating chances but bemoans the poor fielding efforts. Maintains that he has confidence in his young team and hopes they learn quickly.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "With West Indies already under the pump and pitch starting to deteriorate, Yasir Shah breathed fire. He took full toll of the conditions and spun the web on day 4 to push the hosts further. Today, Pakistan showed that they ain't totally dependent on the leggie as their pacers wreaked havoc and wrapped it up quickly in the first session itself. Chasing a scanty 32, what was expected to be a stroll in the park, Pakistan lost three wickets and once again they required the assistance from Misbah to finish it off. Stay tuned as the presentation is coming up shortly...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Two quick wickets by Gabriel gave the hosts some hope but that wasn't meant to be as Misbah-ul-Haq stood solid like a rock. He consumed over 200 balls to tire the bowlers but in the end was left stranded on 99, only to become the first Pakistan batsman to achieve this feat. That didn't matter as his stand of 88 with Sarfraz Ahmed got them a handy lead of 121 runs. Once you get a lead in a Test, it's very rare you lose a game from there.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan go 1-0 up in the series! They completely outclassed the hosts and it was their skipper who is highly responsible for the same. After winning the toss and putting West Indies into bat, Pakistan pacers, in particular Mohammad Amir made full use of the overcast conditions and ran through the Windies line-up. Chase, Dowrich and Holder hung in by scoring their respective fifties and managed to take the score in excess of 275. Pakistan then with the bat didn't get going but the pair of Younis and Azam steadied the ship with their 131-run stand.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "2068", "Commentary": "SIX! Yes he does! Floated ball around middle, Misbah once again sinks down and slog sweeps it over mid-wicket to finish it off in style. He's missed out on a ton in the first innings but he finishes the game this time. PAKISTAN WIN BY 7 WICKETS!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "2068", "Commentary": "SIX! Tonk! Tossed up around middle, Misbah gets down and smacks back it over the bowler's head for a biggie all the way. Can he finish it off with another biggie?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "2068", "Commentary": "Tossed up outside off, defended off the front foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Misbah-ul-Haq is the next man in!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "OUT! LBW! The decision stands! Bishoo drifts it on middle, Younis Khan lunges forward to defend but misses as the bat sticks on the pitch and is hit on the pads. A loud appeal from Bishoo and the umpire raises his finger. Younis Khan takes the review and replays show it to be pitching in line and going on to hit the stumps. That's the end for Younis Khan and what are Pakistan doing? Need 32 and have lost 3 wickets.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "3310", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Younis Khan is adjudged LBW and he takes the review straightaway. Only inside edge can save him.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Tossed up delivery around off, defend off the front foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Fuller on the stumps, Azam flicks it towards square leg for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "24/2", "Over": "10", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "9", "Balls": "22", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3310", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10232", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Short outside off, left alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Short again outside off, Azam dabs it towards gully.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Short of a length ball on middle, defended with a straight bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Outside off, left alone.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Defended off the back foot by the batsman.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Floated delivery outside off, Azam leans into it and drives it along the ground through covers. The ball doesn't have enough legs to reach the fence. They take three.", "Summary": {"Score": "24/2", "Over": "9", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "9", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3310", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11953", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "The batsman has played that off the front foot and into the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Leg bye! Tossed up around middle, Khan gets down to sweep but the ball goes the shoulder past first slip for a leg bye.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Short and around off, Khan stays back and pushes it towards covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Takes a good stride forward and digs it into the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Tossed up ball around middle, Azam comes down the track and pushes it towards mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Slides on the pads, clipped through mid-wicket for a couple.", "Summary": {"Score": "19/2", "Over": "8", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3310", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "6", "Balls": "18", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10232", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Gets forward and pushes it towards covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Younis Khan walks across the stumps, covers it and lets it be.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Fuller in length and outside off, Khan looks to defend but gets an inside edge on the pads as the ball rolls towards the leg side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Fuller in length outside off, it's left alone by the veteran.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10232", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Back of a length delivery outside off, Younis Khan hops back and defends it towards point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Jason Holder brings himself into the attack!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Flighted around off, blocked off the inside half to short leg.", "Summary": {"Score": "17/2", "Over": "7", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "5", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3310", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11953", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Flatter around leg, makes room and punches it towards cover for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Flighted around off, YK presses forward and blocks it to the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Outside leg, Babar works it away on the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "3310", "Commentary": "Loopy and outside leg stump, tucked to deep square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11953", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Floated outside leg, leans across and nudges it gently towards square leg. Cameo off the pads and the batsmen take a leg bye.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Welcome back for the second session. Shouldn't be long before Pakistan seal this although it's never beyond them to create unwanted drama as has been seen with the two wickets already. Devendra Bishoo to start proceedings after lunch.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": ".....DAY 5, SESSION 2.....", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So, the Pakistan batsmen do not opt for the extra 15 minutes and this extended session is dragged into next one. Pakistan will relish the lunch while it won't be the same for the hosts. Though they will be happy to sneak a couple of wickets but that surely won't hamper the visitors. With just 19 needed, expect Pakistan to finish it off quickly once the session starts. Join us for the formalities soon...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": 